<p>
  A <a href="https://tiptap.dev">Tiptap</a> editor using Tiptap's own
  <code>Collaboration</code> and <code>CollaborationCursor</code> extensions.
  ProseMirror's document is stored in a <code>Y.XmlFragment</code> named
  <code>default</code>. Other people's carets and selections come from
  awareness, which the server relays to the room without saving.
</p>
<p>
  The editor is created only after the first sync finishes. When Tiptap's
  Collaboration extension mounts, it writes an empty paragraph into the
  document. If that happens before the server's state arrives, every client
  adds its own starting paragraph to the shared document.
</p>
